      "content": "thanks. that's a start but it feels a bit surface level for a grad paper. can u go deeper into the actual philosophical reasoning? like, instead of just saying they want to \"respect autonomy\" or \"protect sanctity,\" what are the actual moral frameworks or theological doctrines they're using to back those up? i want to see the logic behind both sides",
